y  there are more logistics for that  because we'd need to open the phone  lines every day unless we recorded all  the calls at once which would make some  of them maybe stale and outdated it is  more work on our end but it's an idea  and as many of you know I'm all about  ideas I'm all about big ideas small  ideas medium ideas stale ones new ones  whatever I'm throwing them out to you so  here is how I want to hear from you  about this only by email there's a  reason why it's too easy to just put up  a poll on Twitter or on our website or  on YouTube and let people vote and just  click something without really thinking  about it and the thing is that most  people often don't want anything changed  but if they're given a list of options  they'll just pick something and we get  sort of cloudy data if you actually care  enough to want something changed on the  show whether it  from the options I mentioned or  something different altogether email me  through the contact form at david  pakman.com ok david pakman.com click on  contact fill out that form and tell me  which of these ideas you like if any  tell me if you want everything to stay  as it is tell me if there's a change  that you would like that i have not  mentioned ok all of these ideas and  others I'm willing to consider and the  advantage of having to email me instead  of just clicking a poll is that if you  number one have an idea I didn't mention  we can also include it and consider it I  want those as well but if you want  nothing changed that's also useful to  hear because if 80% of the audience  writes in and says David don't change  anything that's important for us to hear  the whole point here is the show is for  you I want the show to be what people  want in terms of the format obviously  I'm going to still pick the guests I'm  going to still cover the stories I want  to cover but as far as the format goes  let me know what you think I'll give it  like a week or so and then I will come  to you with t